# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# MINUM MALAM SISWA — repository scope
#
# This is a ONE-APP repo. It happens to live inside Desktop\claude, which is
# also a general scratch area: ~120 unrelated files sit next to the app
# (emulator screenshots, course PDFs, Arduino sketches, other side projects,
# a stray .env). None of that belongs in ridzuanshop.
#
# So the rule is a whitelist, not a blacklist: ignore everything at the root,
# then re-admit only the app. That makes `git add -A` safe no matter what
# lands in this folder next — something a blacklist can never guarantee.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

/*

# --- The app: the only things that ship --------------------------------
!/.gitignore
!/drinks-order.html
!/index.html
!/sw.js
!/manifest.json
!/firebase.json
!/firestore.rules
!/qr-duitnow.jpg
!/gen_icons.py
!/icons/
!/icons/**

# --- Documentation ----------------------------------------------------
!/DRINKS-ORDER.md
!/WORKLOG.md
!/AGENTS.md
!/DESIGN.md
!/docs/
!/docs/**
!/.scratch/
!/.scratch/**

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Credentials and private keys — never commit, whatever else changes.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
service-account*.json
*-firebase-adminsdk-*.json
ADMIN-CREDENTIALS.txt
.env

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Everything else is already covered by the `/*` above. Listed here so a
# future reader knows these were considered, not overlooked:
#
#   Screenshots    *.png *.jpeg       (69 emulator/widget captures)
#   Course work    *.pdf *.ino        (CSA20103, maze.ino, buzzer_noises/)
#   Side projects  waktusolat-widget/ transit-widget/ opencut*/ fyp/ STUDY/
#   Scratch        council_extract*.txt emulator_*.png wl*.png NUL
#   Tooling state  .claude/ .agents/ .playwright-mcp/ skills-lock.json
#   Secrets        "C:UserskiifuDesktopclaude.env" (mangled redirect)
#
# Stale pre-Firestore artefacts (Gist era, superseded by Firestore):
#   chk_index.js chk_drinks-order-experiment.js chk_firebase.js
#   drinks-order-experiment.html drinks-order.bak.html
#   drinks-corpus/ drinks-out/      (52 KB July snapshot of the app)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
